# Used server-side only (not exposed to the browser, no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix
# needed) to fetch editable content from /api/cms/home. If unset or
# unreachable, the site just falls back to its built-in defaults — a CMS
# outage should never take the marketing site down with it.
API_BASE_URL=https://api.shanutechx.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.shanutechx.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_URL=https://app.shanutechx.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://shanutechx.com

